# sabotage=PassesDropCalls: behind the pass the only value of the function is gone. A function that a pass has emptied is looked at like any other: the build stops
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: pass RetypeValues
# DIAGNOSTIC: VerificationFailedAfterPass 1
# OPTIONS: check=VerifyEachPass sabotage=PassesDropCalls
# PROGRAM-OF: passes-drop-calls-and-leave-nothing-left-alone.ir
